      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING WINDSOR (2) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by half a length at this track in a handy 30.88. Has a low draw and likes the trip. Winner at his latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Ideally placed to take this out. WILMA'S OUR GIRL (8) scored two back with ease when racing on speed but drifted back and missed the frame latest finishing a 6 length 4th at Gawler (38.05). One of the better chances. TOLEDO (4) recorded his best time this course and distance last start, taking a Grade 6 in 30.96 by 1.3 lengths. Expected to feature again. PAW LEON (7) showed plenty of dash to record a last start win. Must be respected.",
